From 325913222da0ba56022c965959cd72804dbb419e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "herve.marchal" <herve.marchal@developpement-durable.gouv.fr>
Date: Wed, 4 Feb 2026 09:55:42 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] fix(offline): Add missing greenlet dependency to offline
 package
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The offline installation was failing with:
ERROR: No matching distribution found for greenlet<4.0.0,>=3.1.1

greenlet is a required dependency of playwright but was not included
in the offline package wheel downloads.

Changes:
- Add greenlet to pip install command in install-ambulon-offline.bat
- Add greenlet to manual installation instructions in README
- Rebuild offline package v3.0.2 with greenlet wheel included

This ensures offline installation succeeds without Internet connection.

